<% new_email = @resource.try(:unconfirmed_email?) ? @resource.unconfirmed_email : @resource.email %>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">The email address on your Pharma Transport account is being changed to <strong><%= new_email %></strong>.</p>
<p style="font-size:12px;color:#5b6b7c;">If you made this change, there's nothing else to do. If you didn't, reply to this email right away so we can secure your account.</p>
